mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/9c69e7ed7d9709cda98809970efc8ecf.webm?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/9c69e7ed7d9709cda98809970efc8ecf.mp4?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form gangs, fight for control over zones of influence, defend your own territory and lay claim to others. You will have to earn respect by participating in street racing and fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resist EGO, open closed territories, restore a car capable of outrunning the algorithm itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/dce810a99c47017fc410167c7a5eb5d9.poster.avif?t=1784366575\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/dce810a99c47017fc410167c7a5eb5d9.webm?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/dce810a99c47017fc410167c7a5eb5d9.mp4?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the near future on Solanos Island, a place where intelligent technologies were perfected to the extreme. But behind its high-tech order lies a web of secrets, surveillance and corporate power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive on the island in search of your brother, Hardin. To uncover the truth, you must challenge an entire corporation and confront EGO, hidden beneath Solanos’ perfect surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon arriving, you are met by your friend, Max. She reveals that Hardin dug up some dirt on the corporation. Their last conversation was very cryptic, the meeting never took place, and Hardin simply disappeared...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To experience the main storyline, you will step into the role of the main character, Bisha Holm, overcoming numerous obstacles in an attempt to find your brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/15004c3179b4d8e70fb22ffa01435e9a.poster.avif?t=1784366575\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/15004c3179b4d8e70fb22ffa01435e9a.webm?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/15004c3179b4d8e70fb22ffa01435e9a.mp4?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create your own character by scanning yourself at the start of the game. With your personalized avatar, you can explore the island in MMO mode and play in various online modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/b8297c9ff5ac34c25d19116d449166ed.avif?t=1784366575\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bisha Holm (Bee)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bee is the main character, a natural born racer and a hacker's sister. She's not from around here, but she's willing to challenge both street gangs and an all-powerful digital god for her brother's sake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maxine Raze (Max)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max is a supporting character, a no-holds-barred fighter, Bisha's friend and Hardin's girlfriend. Max knows the underbelly of Solanos, can get almost any information and acts as a guide for Bee.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardin Holm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardin is Bee's brother, a brilliant hacker who exposed the rot in a corporation, launched a virus, accidentally awakened AGI (EGO), and then disappeared...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your allies, enemies, reputation and choices will shape your path in RaceOnLife!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/23c7a68ecc07d06c52051e5810378bb7.poster.avif?t=1784366575\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/23c7a68ecc07d06c52051e5810378bb7.webm?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/23c7a68ecc07d06c52051e5810378bb7.mp4?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💬 Message from us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We strive to improve the game with your feedback. We value constructive criticism; your input helps us grow and improve everyone's gaming experience. Don't hesitate to contact us, we welcome every feedback and comment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1784366575\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1784366575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "RaceOnLife: AGI Resistance is an online open-world RPG with legal and illegal races, police chases, gangs, underground fights, and smart NPCs. Play the story, immerse yourself in MMO mode with your scanned avatar, compete in dynamic game modes, confront EGO and win the final race.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Portuguese - Brazil, Hungarian, Vietnamese, Greek, Danish, Indonesian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Finnish, Czech, Swedish, Japanese, Malay, Azerbaijani, Albanian, Amharic, Armenian, Assamese, Afrikaans, Basque, Belarusian, Bangla, Bosnian, Valencian, Welsh, Wolof, Galician, Georgian, Gujarati, Dari, Zulu, Hebrew, Igbo, Irish, Icelandic, Yoruba, Kazakh, Kannada, Catalan, Quechua, Kinyarwanda, K'iche', Konkani, Xhosa, Khmer, Kyrgyz, Latvian, Lithuanian, Luxembourgish, Macedonian, Malayalam, Maltese, Maori, Marathi, Mongolian, Nepali, Odia, Punjabi (Gurmukhi), Punjabi (Shahmukhi), Persian, Serbian, Sotho, Sinhala, Sindhi, Slovak, Slovenian, Sorani, Swahili, Tajik, Tamil, Tatar, Telugu, Tigrinya, Tswana, Turkmen, Uzbek, Uyghur, Urdu, Filipino, Hausa, Hindi, Croatian, Cherokee, Scots, Estonian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/ee4c0c94ffde0e7ef9edf9d4fd1408bee7a622b9/header.jpg?t=1784366575", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/ad922f936ba0a67487b275d75994bca47fac1ddb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784366575", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797460/ad922f936ba0a67487b275d75994bca47fac1ddb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784366575", "website": "https://raceonlife.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</s